      "supersedes": null,
      "contradicted_by": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Its principal town is Benteng, while much smaller towns to the south are Tanabau, Padang, Tile-tile, Pariangan, Galung, Layolo, Pa'garangang, Barangbarang, to Appattanah.",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Selayar_Island",
      "source_type": "reference_work",
      "confidence_tier": "reported",
      "fact_id": "fct_002",
      "first_reported": "2026-08-02",
      "last_updated": "2026-08-02",
      "supersedes": null,
      "contradicted_by": null
    },
    {
      "text": "To the north are Parak, Barugayya, Batangmata, Onto, and finally Bonelohe.",
